    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n3",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the passenger chooses to use biometrics, they should undergo a check using biometrics."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the selection condition, action captures the corresponding check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the passenger prefers to use ID documents, they should undergo checks using identity documents."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the alternative condition, action captures the corresponding check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the passenger chooses to use biometrics, they should undergo a check using biometrics.",
